{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL05ldyUyMEluJTIwVG93biUyMCUyODIwMDklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"New In Town","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/OMCGtMmmBE9NwmawLGZlaErdLk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tZF23SGsjhvzZvtorHLni1BcYYs.jpg","description":"Lucy Hill is an ambitious up-and-coming executive living in Miami. She loves her shoes, her cars, and climbing the corporate ladder. When she is offered a temporary assignment — in the middle of nowhere — to restructure a manufacturing plant, she jumps at the opportunity, knowing that a big promotion is close at hand. What begins as a straightforward assignment becomes a life-changing experience as Lucy discovers greater meaning in her life and, most unexpectedly, the man of her dreams.\n\nRated PG · Released 30 Jan 2009 · United States of America · Language: English · 97 min\nStudio: The Safran Company, Gold Circle Films, Epidemic Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"97 min","cast":["Renée Zellweger","Harry Connick Jr.","J.K. Simmons","Siobhan Fallon Hogan","Mike O'Brien","Frances Conroy","Ferron Guerreiro","Barbara James Smith"],"director":["Jonas Elmer"],"released":"2009-01-30T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"She's an executive on the move. But her career is taking her a little farther than she expected.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jonas Elmer","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aPN8PHoRhOC4mfv3r98LFAmgfDh.jpg"},{"name":"Renée Zellweger","character":"Lucy Hill","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iNnPqkEF0hPWhmWpjyuLuUdbKN8.jpg"},{"name":"Harry Connick Jr.","character":"Ted Mitchell","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/il1t0cshowbZ6mMtH1930baQx9n.jpg"},{"name":"J.K. Simmons","character":"Stu Kopenhafer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ScmKoJ9eiSUOthAt1PDNLi8Fkw.jpg"},{"name":"Siobhan Fal